  Description: You trained at the feet of a knight, maintaining their gear and supporting
    them at tourneys and in battle. Now you search for a challenge that will prove
    you worthy of full knighthood, or you've spurned pomp and ceremony to test yourself
    in honest, albeit less formal, combat. Choose two attribute boosts. One must
    be to Strength or Constitution , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained
    in the Athletics skill and your choice of the Heraldry Lore or Warfare Lore skill.
    You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Armor Assist] skill feat.
